{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-representation","title":"知识表示与推理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-foundations/knowledge-representation","wordCount":2381,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识表示与推理\">知识表示与推理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>智能系统要做出合理的决策，首先需要拥有关于世界的知识，并能够基于这些知识进行推理。知识表示与推理（Knowledge Representation and Reasoning, KR&amp;R）研究如何用形式化的方式在计算机中存储知识、如何利用这些知识推导出新的结论。这是 AI 的核心子领域之一，直接影响着专家系统、语义 Web、知识图谱等重要应用的设计与实现。</p>\n<p>本节涵盖以下核心知识点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>命题逻辑与谓词逻辑的基本原理</li>\n<li>语义网络与框架表示</li>\n<li>本体工程（OWL/RDF）</li>\n<li>贝叶斯推理与概率图模型</li>\n<li>不确定性推理方法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"命题逻辑\">命题逻辑</h3><p><strong>命题逻辑（Propositional Logic）</strong> 是最简单的逻辑系统，它处理的基本单元是命题——只能为真或假的陈述。</p>\n<p>基本逻辑连接词：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\neg</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>非</td>\n<td>取反</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\neg P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>：P 不成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∧</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\land</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∧</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与</td>\n<td>同时成立</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\land Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>：P 且 Q</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∨</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∨</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>或</td>\n<td>至少一个成立</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\lor Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>：P 或 Q</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>蕴含</td>\n<td>若…则…</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\rightarrow Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>：若 P 则 Q</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↔</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>等价</td>\n<td>同真同假</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>↔</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\leftrightarrow Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>命题逻辑的推理基于一组<strong>推理规则</strong>，其中最基础的是<strong>假言推理（Modus Ponens）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{P, \\quad P \\rightarrow Q}{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即：如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为真，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\rightarrow Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为真，则可以推出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为真。</p>\n<p>命题逻辑虽然简洁，但表达能力有限。它无法表示&quot;所有&quot;或&quot;存在&quot;这样的量化概念，也无法处理对象之间的关系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"谓词逻辑\">谓词逻辑</h3><p><strong>一阶谓词逻辑（First-Order Logic, FOL）</strong> 在命题逻辑基础上引入了<strong>个体变量</strong>、<strong>谓词</strong>和<strong>量词</strong>，极大地增强了表达能力。</p>\n<p>核心元素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>常量</strong>：特定对象，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Socrates</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Socrates}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Socrates</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>变量</strong>：任意对象的占位符，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>谓词</strong>：描述对象属性或关系，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Human</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Human}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Human</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Father</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Father}(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Father</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>函数</strong>：从对象到对象的映射，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MotherOf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MotherOf}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MotherOf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>全称量词</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，表示&quot;对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>存在量词</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，表示&quot;存在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经典的苏格拉底三段论可以形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Human</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>Mortal</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x \\, [\\text{Human}(x) \\rightarrow \\text{Mortal}(x)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Human</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mortal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Human</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Socrates</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Human}(\\text{Socrates})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Human</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Socrates</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mtext>Mortal</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Socrates</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore \\text{Mortal}(\\text{Socrates})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6922em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">∴</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mortal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Socrates</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一阶逻辑是 AI 中知识表示的理论基础。Prolog 语言就是一种基于一阶逻辑的编程语言，它通过自动定理证明来执行&quot;程序&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"语义网络\">语义网络</h3><p><strong>语义网络（Semantic Network）</strong> 用图结构来表示知识：节点代表概念或实体，边代表它们之间的关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[鸟] --&gt;|是一种| B[动物]&#10;    C[企鹅] --&gt;|是一种| A&#10;    A --&gt;|能力| D[飞行]&#10;    C --&gt;|不能| D&#10;    A --&gt;|有| E[翅膀]&#10;    C --&gt;|有| E&#10;    A --&gt;|有| F[羽毛]\">graph LR\n    A[鸟] --&gt;|是一种| B[动物]\n    C[企鹅] --&gt;|是一种| A\n    A --&gt;|能力| D[飞行]\n    C --&gt;|不能| D\n    A --&gt;|有| E[翅膀]\n    C --&gt;|有| E\n    A --&gt;|有| F[羽毛]</pre><p>语义网络的优势在于直观性，但它也有明显的局限：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>缺乏形式化的语义定义——相同的图结构可能被不同的人解读为不同的含义</li>\n<li>难以表示量化（&quot;所有鸟都有翅膀&quot; vs &quot;这只鸟有翅膀&quot;）</li>\n<li>继承推理中的异常处理（企鹅是鸟但不会飞）需要额外机制</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"框架表示\">框架表示</h3><p><strong>框架（Frame）</strong> 由 Minsky 在 1975 年提出，它将关于一个概念或对象的所有相关知识组织在一起，用**槽（slot）<strong>和</strong>值（filler）**来描述属性。</p>\n<p>以&quot;鸟&quot;框架为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>槽名</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td>动物</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会飞</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有翅膀</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食物</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>虫子</td>\n<td>字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>腿数</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>整数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>框架通过<strong>继承层次</strong>实现知识复用——&quot;企鹅&quot;框架继承&quot;鸟&quot;框架，但覆盖&quot;会飞&quot;槽为&quot;否&quot;。这种基于默认值和覆盖的推理机制被称为<strong>非单调推理</strong>：新增信息可能推翻之前的结论。</p>\n<p>框架的思想直接影响了面向对象编程（类与继承）以及现代知识图谱的设计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"本体工程-owl-rdf\">本体工程（OWL/RDF）</h3><p><strong>本体（Ontology）</strong> 是对某个领域内概念及其关系的形式化、显式的规范说明。在语义 Web 中，W3C 制定了一套标准技术栈：</p>\n<p><strong>RDF（Resource Description Framework）</strong> 用**三元组（subject, predicate, object）**来表示知识。例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>(北京, 是首都, 中国)</code></li>\n<li><code>(GPT-4, 开发者, OpenAI)</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>RDF 三元组可以自然地构成知识图谱。</p>\n<p><strong>OWL（Web Ontology Language）</strong> 在 RDF 之上提供更丰富的逻辑表达能力，支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>类（Class）层次与子类关系</li>\n<li>属性的定义域和值域</li>\n<li>基数约束（某人最多有一个生物学父亲）</li>\n<li>类的交集、并集、补集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>OWL 的描述逻辑基础使其支持自动推理。例如，定义了&quot;哺乳动物&quot;和&quot;水生动物&quot;的类后，推理引擎可以自动识别鲸鱼同时属于这两个类。</p>\n<p>当代的大型知识图谱（如 Wikidata、Google Knowledge Graph、DBpedia）都建立在 RDF/OWL 技术之上，包含数十亿个事实三元组。</p>\n<h3 id=\"贝叶斯推理\">贝叶斯推理</h3><p>现实世界充满不确定性，逻辑推理往往过于刚性。<strong>贝叶斯推理（Bayesian Reasoning）</strong> 用概率来量化和处理不确定性。</p>\n<p><strong>贝叶斯定理</strong>是概率推理的核心：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(H | E) = \\frac{P(E | H) \\cdot P(H)}{P(E)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(H|E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是在观察到证据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 后假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的后验概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(E|H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是似然，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是先验概率。</p>\n<p>在医疗诊断中，贝叶斯推理的应用非常直观。假设某种疾病的患病率（先验）为 1%，检测的灵敏度（真阳性率）为 99%，特异度为 95%。一个人检测阳性后，实际患病的概率是多少？</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>患病</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>阳性</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.99</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.99</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>16.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{患病}|\\text{阳性}) = \\frac{0.99 \\times 0.01}{0.99 \\times 0.01 + 0.05 \\times 0.99} \\approx 16.7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">患病</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">阳性</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16.7%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个反直觉的结果说明了先验概率的重要性——即使检测很准确，低患病率也会导致大量假阳性。</p>\n<p><strong>贝叶斯网络（Bayesian Network）</strong> 是一种有向无环图（DAG），节点表示随机变量，边表示条件依赖关系。它利用条件独立性大幅简化联合概率分布的表示和计算，是处理复杂不确定性推理的强大工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不确定性推理方法\">不确定性推理方法</h3><p>除了贝叶斯方法，AI 中还有多种处理不确定性的推理框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>确定性因子（Certainty Factor）</strong>：MYCIN 专家系统使用的方法，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 范围的数值表示信念程度</li>\n<li><strong>模糊逻辑（Fuzzy Logic）</strong>：允许命题具有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的真值度，适合处理&quot;有点热&quot;&quot;非常高&quot;这类模糊概念</li>\n<li><strong>Dempster-Shafer 理论</strong>：将信念分配给命题的子集而非单个命题，能够区分&quot;不知道&quot;和&quot;可能性相同&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>马尔可夫逻辑网络（Markov Logic Network）</strong>：将一阶逻辑与概率图模型结合，每条逻辑规则附带一个权重</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每种方法都有其适用场景。贝叶斯方法在数据充足时表现最优；模糊逻辑适合控制系统；Dempster-Shafer 理论在证据不完整时有独特优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>逻辑形式化</strong>：将以下自然语言知识用一阶谓词逻辑表示：(a) 所有学生都要参加考试；(b) 至少有一个学生通过了数学考试；(c) 如果一个学生既聪明又努力，那么他会通过考试。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>贝叶斯计算</strong>：某地区 0.1% 的人携带某种病毒。快速检测的灵敏度为 95%，特异度为 99%。如果你的检测结果为阳性，实际感染的概率是多少？如果连续检测两次都为阳性呢？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>本体设计</strong>：为一个&quot;大学课程系统&quot;设计一个简单的本体。定义至少 5 个类（如课程、教师、学生等）及其之间的关系，用类似 RDF 三元组的方式描述。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>框架建模</strong>：用框架表示法为&quot;智能手机&quot;创建一个知识框架，包含至少 8 个槽。然后创建一个&quot;iPhone 16&quot;子框架，展示继承与覆盖机制。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>对比反思</strong>：逻辑推理要求知识是确定和完备的，而贝叶斯推理接受不确定性。在哪些场景下你会优先选择逻辑方法？在哪些场景下概率方法更合适？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>逻辑基础</strong>：Michael Genesereth &amp; Nils Nilsson,《Logical Foundations of Artificial Intelligence》，系统介绍 AI 中逻辑方法的经典著作。</li>\n<li><strong>概率推理</strong>：Judea Pearl,《Probabilistic Reasoning in Intelligent Systems》，贝叶斯网络创始人的奠基之作。</li>\n<li><strong>知识图谱</strong>：Amit Singhal, &quot;Introducing the Knowledge Graph&quot;（Google Official Blog, 2012），了解工业界如何大规模应用知识图谱。</li>\n<li><strong>本体实践</strong>：Protégé（<a href=\"https://protege.stanford.edu/），斯坦福大学开发的开源本体编辑器，可以动手实践\">https://protege.stanford.edu/），斯坦福大学开发的开源本体编辑器，可以动手实践</a> OWL 本体的构建。</li>\n<li><strong>中文资源</strong>：陈华钧等，《知识图谱：方法、实践与应用》，电子工业出版社，系统介绍知识图谱的中文教材。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>知识表示与推理是让机器&quot;知道&quot;并&quot;思考&quot;的基础。从命题逻辑到谓词逻辑，我们获得了形式化表示和精确推理的能力；语义网络和框架提供了更直观的知识组织方式；OWL/RDF 标准使得大规模知识共享成为可能；贝叶斯推理和其他不确定性方法则让 AI 能够在信息不完整的现实世界中做出合理决策。这些经典方法至今仍在知识图谱、专家系统和混合 AI 系统中发挥重要作用，并与当代的深度学习方法形成互补——神经网络擅长从数据中学习模式，而知识表示方法擅长利用已有知识进行结构化推理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"知识表示与推理","id":"知识表示与推理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"命题逻辑","id":"命题逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"谓词逻辑","id":"谓词逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"语义网络","id":"语义网络"},{"level":3,"text":"框架表示","id":"框架表示"},{"level":3,"text":"本体工程（OWL/RDF）","id":"本体工程-owl-rdf"},{"level":3,"text":"贝叶斯推理","id":"贝叶斯推理"},{"level":3,"text":"不确定性推理方法","id":"不确定性推理方法"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搜索与优化算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-foundations/search-optimization"},"next":{"title":"神经网络基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning/neural-network-fundamentals"}}